<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- NAMBYA TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">Judi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lukwalo Lwakakwalwa naJudi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Judi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jud</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lukwalo Lwakakwalwa na</para>
  <para style="mt1">JUDI</para>
  <para style="imt">Matangisilo</para>
  <para style="ip">Lukwalo lwaJudi lunezina lwonkwali walyo. Judi unozwizibisa sonuna waJemusi ununa waJesu. Unotolwa soumwe wabanuna baJesu (Judi 1). Atitoziba kuti yolulukwalo lwakabakanangana negubungano akale nokuleba nezweChivumilano Chantolo, babali botanga baJudi bananga bakabeli baJuda. Koga, lukwalo lulwe ulolukwalila “bose baloshobwa, balodikana munaMwali Tate akale balolondotelwa Jesu Kristo” (Judi 1). Lukwalo lungaba lwakakwalwa pelyo kwamakumi mashanu anegumi mushule mokuzwalwa kwaJesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chinangwa chiche chokwala lukwalo yolu kumaKristo wose kwakabeli kubachenjeja kuti besilashwe nabalayiji boniepa (Judi 4). Unoshingisa zwitiko nendebo jinova kuChivumilano Chantolo kusimatija indangalilo iye. Yolu lukwalo luna zwinji zwalunotolelejana nolukwalo lwabili lwaPita, zwishanganyila kuchenjeja nozwabalayiji boniepa (Judi 4, 2 Pita 2.1) akale nokulebeleka nezwejingilozi neSodoma neGomola.</para>
  <para style="iot">Zwilomumwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Judi unotanga nokulebeleka nababali bolukwalo lulwe (Judi 1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Zwinotobela unotondejela chisoko chokukwala kulikuchenjeja nezwabalayiji boniepa (Judi 3-4)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mushule mwezwi unopa mikwejaniso inova kubanhu akale nezwitiko muChivumilano Chantolo (Judi 5-16)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kova eleba kuti banokwelela kuta chini mukuchenjejwa (Judi 17-23)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kumapejelejo unokonya lukwalo lulwe nokukuja Mwali (Judi 24-25)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Imi Judi unshingi waJesu Kristo akale ununa waJemusi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">Kunaabo bakashobwa, badikani baMwali Tate akale belondotelwa Jesu Kristo.<verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Ishe, lunyalalo, noludo zwiwande mwamuli.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balayiji boniepa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Badikani, ndikasungwala kumukwalila noluchijo lwedu tose, ndawana zwikakwelela kuti ndimukwalile ndimuteteja kuti mulwile kudimbwa kwakaswinchwa kubachena kamwempela konshaji wose. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Nokuti bamwe banhu banakutongwa kwabo kwakakwalwa nezwako ntolo bakangwina pakati penu bakabwata. Bakalebo banhu abana bumwali, banoshandulila chipiwo chaMwali wedu kuti betubule kuta buhungu akale belamba Jesu Kristo, Tezi wedu umwempela.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Ngweno ndoda kumukumbuluja, kojoba umwe unshaji mwakabazibiswa zwizhele, kuti Tezi wakachija banhu ebabhisa kunyika yeIjipiti, kwapinda unshaji wakapalaja yabo basakadimbwa. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Akale ingilozi jisakalondota zwigalo zwajo koga jikasiya bugalo bwajo bulojikwelela, jilolondotwa naiye munhilima, jikasungwa namaketani, kwemisi isinopela, jikamilila izhuba igulwana lyokutongwa. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Nenzila ilotojana, iSodoma neGomola namakuta akaba elipelyo, bakata zwilokwelana sezwakata ingilozi jakabeta busangu akale beli mubupenyu bokulakamila zwisili zwombumbilo, bakashingiswa sechitondejelo nokulangwa nomoto usinopela.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Akale munzila imwempela yaba banhu mumaloto abo banoswibhisa mibili yabo, banolamba butongo, akale banotuka ibo banokujwa bokudenga. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Koga Mayikolo ingilozi ihulwana paakalwana naguluzhanje, benyenyejana nozwontumbu waMozesi, aajakompa undandu una kutuka. Koga wakati, “Tezi ekukalalile.” <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Koga yaba banhu banotuka zwose zwabasinowhisisa, akale neezwo zwinhu zwabanoziba nokubona sezwinotiwa nemhuka jisinoyeya, ndizwo zwichabapalajwa. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Bujiili kwabali! Nokuti bamukwenda munzila yaKeyini, akale bamuzwilasha kuti bebe nengwano muluchinyo saBhalamu, akale bepalale mubupanduki bwaKola. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Yaba banhu zwibata zwibi pemiliya yenu yoludo, belya pamwempela namwi besinotya, balyisi banozwilondota ibo, samakole asina ivula, esundwa nebhepo, miti isina michelo kumapejelejo egoloka, yakafa, ikanyukulwa. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Bananga sama nkapo egungwa anotyisa, anopupuma ifulu lyawo linoswabisa, inyenyeji jilopamhala jilolondotelwa inhilima isinopela.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Inoki wechizekululu chechishanu china zwibili kuva kunaAdamu wakapolofita eti, “Lingani, Tezi unoozha nezwiulu zwezwiulu zwabachena, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />kootonga bose, akale nokubawana belinondandu pezhulu pezwito zwabo zwibi zwibakata munzila yokusoba nobumwali, nomumawhi ose obukali abachinyi basina bumwali abakabelebeleka bubi nozwizwe.”<verse eid="JUD 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Yaba banhu bagele benyunyuta, akale banogala bengunguna, banotobela lulakamilo lwabo lubi, banozwikuja, banobembeka bamwe kutila kuti bewane zwabamuda.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zwichenjejo neNdayijo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Koga badikani, mokwelela kukumbuluka, kulebambeli kwabapositoli baTezi wedu Jesu Kristo. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Bakati kwamuli, “Munshaji opejeleja kunooba banoseka bamwe, betobela lulakamilo lwabo lusina bumwali.” <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Yaba ndibo banobuza imhalalano, kubanhu bezwenyika, basina uMpepo. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Koga imwi, badikani, zwibakeni mukudimbwa kwenu kuchena kasakasa, munamate muMpepo uNchena, <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />zwilondoteni muludo lwaMwali, mililani ishe jaTezi wedu Jesu Kristo kuti jimubuze kubupenyu businopela.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Tondejelani ishe kunaibo banokahajika, <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />chijani bamwe, nokubavupula mumoto, kunabamwe ibani neshe jiloshangana nolutyo, mubenga nechimbalo chiloswibhiswa nezwilakamilo zwombili.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unamato woluKujo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Kwaali unotubula kumulondota kuti musiwe akale emupila musina kabata mbeli kokungaima kukwe nolushanto lukulwana, <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />kunaMwali umwempela uNchiji wedu, munaJesu Kristo Tezi wedu, kube lukujo, bushaninga, isimba nobutongi, konshaji wose womushule, ngweno akale kwemisi isinopela. Ameni.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>